{"name": "Roam", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/5461a1e0d7e26f2e3c94de7cc1959ef1.apng?t=1788555531\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/5461a1e0d7e26f2e3c94de7cc1959ef1.poster.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"/></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/6ce1f158f4004f46cfde9669baf981e1.apng?t=1788555531\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"311\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/6ce1f158f4004f46cfde9669baf981e1.poster.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The lands of <strong>ROAM</strong> are filled with hidden treasures and ancient artifacts. Yet the greatest mystery lies beneath the Azure Lake, where a vast network of tunnels has existed since ancient times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a brave wanderer, you will descend into a dark world of forgotten caverns and underground ruins, explore its depths, and uncover the secrets hidden below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dungeons &amp; Procedural Generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/c1222934e2dac6936b9d323cff6a43f1.poster.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/c1222934e2dac6936b9d323cff6a43f1.webm?t=1788555531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/c1222934e2dac6936b9d323cff6a43f1.mp4?t=1788555531\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of <strong>ROAM</strong> is a vast network of procedurally generated caves. Random hazards and events ensure that no two journeys are the same, but knowledge of previously explored areas, along with clever use of your equipment and consumables, will help you adapt to dangerous situations\u2014or avoid them entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br/><strong>Grappling Hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/8c29a50baddc0df7186b963a2bdf9d09.poster.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/8c29a50baddc0df7186b963a2bdf9d09.webm?t=1788555531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/8c29a50baddc0df7186b963a2bdf9d09.mp4?t=1788555531\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the game's core mechanics is the <strong>Grappling Hook</strong>. Use it to latch onto walls, swing across chasms, discover hidden passages, escape from enemies, or pull them toward you. Both combat and platforming are deeply built around mastering this versatile tool.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/acf8f18490edc7bde0a1538c5cfe2166.poster.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/acf8f18490edc7bde0a1538c5cfe2166.webm?t=1788555531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/acf8f18490edc7bde0a1538c5cfe2166.mp4?t=1788555531\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In addition to deadly platforming, you will:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through a hostile underground using a wide variety of weapons, equipment, and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources and craft new gear and consumables at campfires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and unlock new skills by defeating enemies and crafting items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and enchant your equipment with the help of blacksmiths and alchemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet fellow wanderers on your descent, including merchants, mages, and craftsmen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for secrets and treasures hidden in the deepest and most inaccessible corners of the underground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Explore, fight, survive!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/4cf5c6b2f761cfd96247ce01644161da.apng?t=1788555531\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"173\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/4cf5c6b2f761cfd96247ce01644161da.poster.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"/></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/extras/b8f63ff574194a38643a0bc397c89312.avif?t=1788555531\" width=\"780\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "\"Roam\" is a 2D Action-RPG platformer set in a procedurally generated world. Explore the surrounding lands and delve into the depths of mysterious caves that have lain hidden for centuries beneath the Azure Lake.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662550/6c0ce0aa6c1f4182bba997de92b68ad098a0f29e/header.jpg?t=1788555531", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Crafting", "RPG", "Atmospheric", "Adventure", "Action", "2D"], "developers": "Luv3nder", "publishers": "Luv3nder", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2662550", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "4 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/c42bNPQP7lo", "first_seen": 1788472800.0, "review_rank": 0}